<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Jan 13.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Jan 13.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd A$1.93 (+.06)</p>
<p>*Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd A$6.10</p>
<p>PBL announces before market open that it plans to buy 10 percent of Sydney Harbour Casino from Showboat Inc and take management control of the casino.</p>
<p>*Advance Bank Australia Ltd A$7.08 (+.05)</p>
<p>*St George Bank Ltd A$7.46 (-.18)</p>
<p>Advance Bank shareholders to vote on the change in the bank's articles of association and capital reduction as prelude to merger with St George.</p>
<p>*FAI Insurance Ltd A$.71 (steady)</p>
<p>Insurer's shareholders to vote on the group's plans to issue 25 million converting preference shares at A$2.0 a share raising A$50 million.</p>
<p>*Highlands Gold Ltd A$.78 (-.03)</p>
<p>Highlands announces after market close on Friday it was unsuccessful in its attempt to receive underwriting support for a capital raising as part of restructure and continues to reject Placer Dome Inc's 75 cents a share offer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
